<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύσσημ-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμβολον</span>
			, <i>signal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				4.1
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδώκει ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				14.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς. ἀνέβη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jd.</u>
					20.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴρειν τὸ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.3.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦρε τὸ συγκείμενον πρὸς μάχην
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				20.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stamp</i> on weights and measures, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ συσσήμου πωλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					15.1.51
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>badge, ensign</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῆς ἀρχῆς
			ς</span>. <i>insignia, regalia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.70
			</span></i>; <i>token, means of recognition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				362
			</span></i> (censured by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				393
			</span></i>): metaph. of a patronymic, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Vit.Hom.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>pledge, pawn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hedyl.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.345b
			</span></i>.</div>
